comment_regular_data.body:
@nfnty This looks like a bug in `path_get_absolute_path()`, not `FullName_save()`. @brammool I don't think this bug is in Vim, sorry for the noise.

Seems like an off-by-one error that wasn't noticed because normally this line in `path_get_absolute_path()` is allocated with size `MAXPATHL`, which "usually" is more than enough room.

    char *relative_directory = xmalloc(len);
